-- 数据查询注册块 131（休眠）：mor-test 阶段 7 在 mor_platform 执行（root，客户端 utf8mb4）。
-- 内容逐字取自 paytech/platform-support/docs/database/sql/platform-support-initial-data.sql 末尾「Operations data query console」块
-- （提交 9a209e6f）；自带事务，234 行。前置：changes/2026-10-22-data-query.sql 已执行；00-precheck 块 131 为空。
SET NAMES utf8mb4;

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Operations data query console (2026-10-22, requirements/20261022/platform-support-数据查询服务).
-- Self-contained block: on an environment already initialized by platform-support-initial-data.sql, apply ONLY this block.
-- Requires the data query tables (changes/2026-10-22-data-query.sql) for the Platform code it activates.
-- Dormant like earlier Operations features: permissions ACTIVE, administrator grants REVOKED, menus and routes DISABLED;
-- activate them in a separate reviewed change. BFF routes forward to operations-console-bff on the same path
-- (/data-query-admin/v1/..., /data-query/v1/...), which calls DataSourceManagementApi, QueryTemplateManagementApi and
-- DataQueryExecutionApi on platform-support-service; operator identity comes from the Gateway actor headers.
-- Permissions: DATA_QUERY_READ (LOW, lists and details), DATA_SOURCE_MANAGE (HIGH, data source writes and connection tests),
-- DATA_QUERY_TEMPLATE_MANAGE (HIGH, template writes, validation and trial), DATA_QUERY_EXECUTE (LOW, run any ACTIVE
-- template); the requirement's NORMAL level maps to LOW because t_permission.risk_level only allows LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH/CRITICAL.
-- Menus: top-level group 数据查询 (sort 65) with 数据源 /data-query/data-sources and 查询模板 /data-query/templates; the template
-- editor is a frontend sub-route of 查询模板 and needs no registration. Buttons 维护 OPERATIONS_DATA_SOURCE_MANAGE (under 数据源,
-- DATA_SOURCE_MANAGE) and OPERATIONS_DATA_QUERY_TEMPLATE_MANAGE (under 查询模板, DATA_QUERY_TEMPLATE_MANAGE) gate the write actions.
-- Routes: 18, headers and guard rules copy block 125 (GET: authorization + origin; body or DELETE: plus content-type for
-- bodies and idempotency-key, with idempotency_mode NONE like block 125). Query whitelists: data source list status/engineType/keyword/page/size, template list
-- dataSourceId/status/keyword/page/size, version list page/size, delete expectedVersion. Template validation is called by
-- the editor with a 500 ms debounce, so its CLIENT_IP and AUTHENTICATED_PRINCIPAL rate limits are 120/min instead of 10;
-- trial keeps the write limits (principal 10/min) and execution uses the read limits (30/min).
-- Rows: permission 4, role_permission 4, console_resource 5, gateway_route 18, route_header 82, query_param 13,
-- guard_rule 108 (234). ID block 131: 1311xx permission, 1312xx role_permission, 1313xx console_resource, 1314xx route,
-- 1315xx route_header, 1316xx query_param, 1317xx-1318xx guard_rule.
-- Before applying, re-check on the live mor_platform that no row in 900000000000131001-900000000000131999 exists and that
-- the permission codes, resource codes, route codes and (method, external path) pairs above are unused.
-- Rollback: delete the rows by the 900000000000131001-900000000000131999 IDs below (children first: guard_rule, query_param,
-- route_header, gateway_route, console_resource, role_permission, permission).
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
START TRANSACTION;

SET @data_query_console_time = UTC_TIMESTAMP(6);
SET @data_query_console_actor_id = 1;
SET @data_query_console_target_id = 900000000000000001;
SET @data_query_console_role_id = 900000000000000510;








COMMIT;
